      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 62.18,
      "end_seconds": 84.69,
      "duration_seconds": 22.51,
      "text": "She is on alendronate 70 milligrams once a week I give it to her. She takes allopurinol 100 milligrams once a day for the gout. She takes Eltroxin 100 micrograms every morning for my thyroid. It's paracetamol 1 gram when needed doctor."
    },
