      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.12,
      "end_seconds": 116.85,
      "duration_seconds": 10.73,
      "text": "I have thin bones, for about a year. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit. I told my wife I'd come today."
