      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.25,
      "end_seconds": 320.81,
      "duration_seconds": 25.56,
      "text": "from what you've told me and what I found this is probably a probable hip fracture i'm sending you for blood tests because of pre-operative the treatment will be morphine 2.5 milligrams now single dose that's for hip pain lie still I am arranging an ambulance and pain relief we'll refer you to the orthopaedic team"
